•Project management (Agile) & tools (Jira, Confluence);
•Programming ( Java, Node.js, Python)
•Data storage technologies for structured (SQL Server, Postgres) and unstructured (MongoDB, Neo4j) data;
•Front end web technology (Angular, React JS, Javascript);
•Testing tool (Selenium, Cucumber);
